== R1. Toy reversal: crossing sigma/B of dh (tau 4->16), one-sided, under three hazard definitions ==
  naive P/tau                           : sign changes at sigma/B = [0.308]
  renewal P/E[min(T,tau)] (=1/MFPT)     : sign changes at sigma/B = [0.353]
  survival -ln(1-P)/tau                 : sign changes at sigma/B = [0.343]

