  B Poisson-rate reset          : pinned zG=0.259 (zM=3.86); eps_tau=1.75; HR/doubling=3.37; max diffusive share at HR<=1.087: 3.7%
  C OU restoring                : pinned zG=0.421 (zM=2.37); eps_tau=4.05; HR/doubling=16.56; max diffusive share at HR<=1.087: 0.6%
  lognormal intervals sd(ln)=2  : pinned zG=0.139 (zM=7.19); eps_tau=0.11; HR/doubling=1.08; max diffusive share at HR<=1.087: 100.0%
  Pareto intervals kappa=1.2    : pinned zG=0.185 (zM=5.40); eps_tau=0.27; HR/doubling=1.21; max diffusive share at HR<=1.087: 41.9%
  Pareto intervals kappa=1.05   : pinned zG=0.181 (zM=5.52); eps_tau=0.12; HR/doubling=1.09; max diffusive share at HR<=1.087: 98.1%

